### 代码

* java

```java
class Solution {
     public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {
      if (prices == null || prices.length<2){
        return 0;
    }
    int profit1 = Integer.MAX_VALUE;
    int profit =0;
    for (int i = 0;i<prices.length;i++){
        profit=Math.max(profit,prices[i]-profit1);
        profit1 = Math.min(profit1,prices[i]);
    }
    if (profit<0){
        return 0;
    }
    else {
        return  profit;
    }
}
}
```

